OL,3,GNEWSABoy died from multiple injuries in
OL,4,ACyprus hotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two-year-old boy who fell to his
OL,7,Fdeath from a fourth-floor window of a
OL,8,FCyprus hotel died from multiple severe
OL,9,Finjuries, a coroner has said.
OL,11,FJaxon Foster tumbled nearly 40ft (12m)
OL,12,Fat the five-star King Evelthon Beach
OL,13,FHotel and Resort on 12 July, the first
OL,14,Fday of his family holiday in Chlorakas.
OL,16,FThe boy, from Chelmsford, suffered
OL,17,Ffatal injuries to his head, vital
OL,18,Forgans and body, an inquest at Essex
OL,19,FCoroner's Court has heard. The inquest
OL,20,Fwas opened and adjourned on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
