OL,3,GNEWSABoy died from multiple injuries in
OL,4,ACyprus hotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FJaxon's father, Joshua, was fined
OL,7,FbB,3,000 (#2,500) at a court in Paphos
OL,8,Fin October, having admitted causing his
OL,9,Fdeath through a reckless, rash or
OL,10,Fdangerous act.
